SUMMARY:World Series of Birding – Introductory Walk
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to the World Series of Birding Introductory Walk! \nCome support our annual fundraising World Series of Birding with a bird walk at Scherman Hoffman Wildlife Sanctuary. Whether you’re a seasoned birder or just starting out\, this event is perfect for all levels of bird enthusiasts. \nDuring this introductory walk\, you’ll have the opportunity to learn about our three 2026 World Series of Birding teams: Scherman Hoffman Century Run\, Scherman Hoffman Deckcissels\, and our youth team the Sherman Hoffman Jay Walkers. Donations to these teams support all that we do at NJ Audubon\, and you’ll have the opportunity to donate to the team(s) of your choice when you arrive for the bird walk. \nDon’t miss this chance to connect with nature and discover the beauty of birdwatching\, and the diverse bird species that call the sanctuary home. Our experienced guide will help you spot and identify various birds while sharing interesting facts about their behaviors and habitats. Grab your binoculars and join us for a morning filled with birding adventures! No worries if you don’t own binoculars we have loaner binoculars for you in our Nature Store! \nIMPORTANT INFORMATION: \n\nMake sure to wear sturdy shoes as we may be walking on trails and uneven ground.\nPlease meet in the lower parking lot.\nThe walk is cancelled if there is snow\, rain\, or weather warnings.\nRegistration required before the walk.\n\nCOST: FREE\, Donations to our WSB teams are appreciated but not required. \n\n\n\n\n\nInterested in becoming a member? Please click on the following link to learn more or join: Become a Member today! \nCANCELLATION: NJ Audubon’s programs require a minimum number of registrants to run. If we cancel\, due to lack of participation\, severe weather\, or unforeseen circumstances\, all participants will be notified as soon as possible and are eligible for a full refund. Participants may cancel without penalty if greater than 48 hours in advance. Sorry\, no refund for cancellations less than 48 hours in advance unless due to health emergencies; however\, registrations can be transferred to another program in the future. \n\n\nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://njaudubon.org/event/world-series-of-birding-introductory-walk-5/
LOCATION:New Jersey Audubon’s Scherman Hoffman Wildlife Sanctuary\, 11 Hardscrabble Road\, Bernardsville\, NJ\, 07924\, United States
CATEGORIES:Bird Walk,Birding,Nature Walk,Scherman Hoffman Wildlife Sanctuary,WSB
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://njaudubon.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/World-Series-of-Birding-intro-walk-05-10-25.jpeg
GEO:40.7448693;-74.5523161
