SUMMARY:Tiny Tots World Series of Birding
DESCRIPTION:Tiny Tots World Series of Birding \nJoin us for a fun-filled day at the Tiny Tots World Series of Birding! Bring your little nature enthusiasts to explore the wonders of birding in a kid-friendly environment. Lorrimer Sanctuary’s Tiny Tots Team welcomes the youngest birders\, those 18 months to 7 years\, to search the Sanctuary for birds! For many of our team members\, this is their first birdwatching experience EVER\, so we make this day super fun with a scavenger hunt\, touchable items\, and crafts! \nThe program is free\, but we encourage all participants to join our team and help fundraise for Lorrimer Sanctuary! World Series of Birding: Lorrimer Sanctuary Tiny Tots – New Jersey Audubon Society \nThis is a grown-up and me program! Please sign up for each participating child. \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://njaudubon.org/event/tiny-tots-world-series-of-birding/
LOCATION:Lorrimer Sanctuary\, 790 Ewing Avenue\, Franklin Lakes\, NJ\, 07417\, United States
CATEGORIES:Birding,Children's Program,Lorrimer Sanctuary,WSB
